WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 8]

01:45.380 --> 01:46.259
Senior.

01:46.259 --> 01:47.190
Have some water.

01:55.259 --> 01:56.160
Senior...

01:56.160 --> 01:57.100
What's wrong with you?

01:57.100 --> 01:58.830
Are you all right, senior?

02:00.260 --> 02:01.140
I'm fine.

02:01.140 --> 02:02.180
Leave me alone.

02:02.180 --> 02:03.110
You can off to go.

02:10.860 --> 02:11.600
Senior,

02:12.210 --> 02:13.790
I have something to ask you.

02:28.700 --> 02:29.350
Lu Li.

02:30.100 --> 02:31.160
What's the matter?

02:31.700 --> 02:32.750
How do you

02:33.140 --> 02:35.340
explain the fire in the Pearl Pavilion?

02:36.170 --> 02:37.829
This matter has been conclusively attributed

02:37.829 --> 02:39.230
to the grass demon.

02:40.340 --> 02:41.940
You're still suspecting me?

02:42.250 --> 02:43.710
I'm so sad about this.

02:46.380 --> 02:47.360
I'm sad too.

02:48.770 --> 02:49.390
Senior.

02:49.940 --> 02:52.600
It seems that time would really change a person.

02:53.340 --> 02:54.470
Listen to yourself.

02:54.940 --> 02:56.070
What have I changed?

02:57.100 --> 02:59.790
Actually, you're the one who has been changing.

03:02.620 --> 03:04.480
We grew up together.

03:04.480 --> 03:06.070
Master's way of educating us

03:06.070 --> 03:08.020
was to leave us in the barren mountains

03:08.020 --> 03:10.020
and let us live on our own abilities.

03:10.500 --> 03:12.230
So we had to learn to be ruthless

03:12.580 --> 03:13.350
and tough.

03:14.220 --> 03:15.510
But do you remember

03:16.060 --> 03:18.510
that we agreed

03:19.500 --> 03:21.230
not to kill innocent people?

03:23.100 --> 03:24.230
Of course I do.

03:24.540 --> 03:26.350
So how are you going to explain the fire in Pearl Pavilion?

03:26.350 --> 03:27.700
If it wasn't because I and Liu Shao's spiritual power restrained each other,

03:27.700 --> 03:28.680
and we had special physical constitutions,

03:28.680 --> 03:30.190
and if I hadn't arrived at the scene in time,

03:30.190 --> 03:32.250
the demon fire would have killed her.

03:32.250 --> 03:33.070
What if

03:33.780 --> 03:35.110
I just meant to kill her?

03:36.420 --> 03:37.030
Senior.

03:40.230 --> 03:41.230
I will protect her

03:42.940 --> 03:44.230
with my life.

03:44.860 --> 03:46.120
Don't make me hate you.

03:50.740 --> 03:51.470
Lu Li.

03:52.579 --> 03:53.870
You won't kill me.

03:54.380 --> 03:56.310
Beacuse you're too affectionate.

03:56.740 --> 03:59.150
You've been pretending to be cruel.

03:59.700 --> 04:00.760
Stop acting tough.

04:07.540 --> 04:09.340
The demon fire belongs to Ao Hen,

04:09.450 --> 04:11.020
and that mark belongs to you.

04:11.020 --> 04:13.150
You should know what will happen to you

04:13.500 --> 04:14.700
if I tell master about this,

04:14.700 --> 04:15.710
right?

04:16.700 --> 04:18.300
Master is different from me.

04:18.740 --> 04:20.339
No matter who that person is,

04:20.579 --> 04:22.820
no matter how close that person is to him,

04:22.820 --> 04:24.000
he won't care.

04:27.220 --> 04:27.830
Lu Li.

04:28.900 --> 04:30.230
You won't do that.

04:30.820 --> 04:32.420
You always say I've changed.

04:32.540 --> 04:33.670
Maybe you're right.

04:35.090 --> 04:36.090
I will do anything

04:38.220 --> 04:39.590
for Liu Shao.

04:41.620 --> 04:43.820
I know you don't want to see me like that,

04:44.100 --> 04:45.030
and neither do I.

05:18.860 --> 05:19.660
Captain Fang.

05:20.490 --> 05:22.490
How is the Lord's refinement going?

05:22.940 --> 05:24.340
It seems to be going well.

05:24.940 --> 05:26.270
The Lord is saved.

05:26.580 --> 05:28.300
And the human world is saved too.

05:28.300 --> 05:29.030
That's good.

05:52.850 --> 05:53.390
Done?

05:56.820 --> 05:57.430
Yep.

06:07.900 --> 06:09.160
What's wrong, My Lord?

06:10.140 --> 06:10.830
My Lord!

06:11.500 --> 06:12.200
My Lord!

06:14.900 --> 06:15.590
My Lord!

06:16.740 --> 06:17.550
My Lord!

06:24.100 --> 06:26.150
Wan Sui took the blame for this?

06:26.150 --> 06:27.300
I think it

06:27.300 --> 06:28.740
must have something to do with Bai Feng

06:28.740 --> 06:30.030
and Du Mingchong.

06:37.580 --> 06:38.350
Liu Shao.

06:38.740 --> 06:40.540
I want to pull out the Moon Sword.

06:45.780 --> 06:46.310
Okay.

06:46.740 --> 06:47.540
I'll help you.

06:48.300 --> 06:49.670
You are not asking why?

06:49.670 --> 06:50.730
You told me

06:50.730 --> 06:53.300
that you wanted the mighty power of the Moon Sword

06:53.300 --> 06:55.580
to counter those machinations

06:55.580 --> 06:58.240
and protect the people you wanted to protect.

06:58.240 --> 06:59.300
You want to protect me.

06:59.300 --> 07:00.700
You want me to stop being afraid of Ao Hen

07:00.700 --> 07:02.780
even after I leave Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

07:02.780 --> 07:03.670
I told you

07:04.620 --> 07:05.820
I would take you home.

07:05.940 --> 07:07.980
You will eventually leave Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

07:07.980 --> 07:09.070
and go home.

07:12.340 --> 07:13.110
But

07:13.460 --> 07:14.390
I have a request.

07:16.180 --> 07:18.350
Even if you gain great power,

07:18.660 --> 07:20.940
and I continue to hire you to protect me, but you can't...

07:20.940 --> 07:22.340
You can't overcharge me.

07:23.860 --> 07:24.660
You're right.

07:25.300 --> 07:27.740
I charged you 30,000 taels of silver before,

07:27.740 --> 07:29.860
but I forgot to mention the time limit.

07:29.860 --> 07:32.080
What... You want to increase the price?

07:34.380 --> 07:35.780
Then I'll set a time limit

07:36.060 --> 07:37.150
until

07:38.220 --> 07:40.220
the day I can't protect you anymore.

07:41.620 --> 07:43.070
What day is that?

07:47.659 --> 07:49.520
The day I can't protect a loved one

07:49.690 --> 07:51.290
the day I am no longer needed,

07:52.380 --> 07:54.240
and the day my life comes to an end.

07:56.180 --> 07:57.590
That day will not come.

08:00.540 --> 08:01.710
And even if it does,

08:03.900 --> 08:05.150
I will protect you.

08:12.740 --> 08:13.880
But

08:14.620 --> 08:17.040
who is the loved one you mentioned just now?

08:46.660 --> 08:47.390
Liu Shao.

08:48.660 --> 08:50.300
In fact, there is another reason

08:50.300 --> 08:52.300
why I want to pull out the Moon Sword.

08:52.780 --> 08:54.710
I want to figure out my background.

08:59.540 --> 09:00.880
Your background?

09:00.890 --> 09:02.390
It was my master

09:03.580 --> 09:05.700
who asked me to come to Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

09:05.700 --> 09:06.670
And Bai Feng…

09:07.010 --> 09:08.080
Here they are!

09:08.740 --> 09:09.240
Hurry!

09:09.240 --> 09:10.170
-Hurry! -Hurry!

09:27.820 --> 09:28.310
Go.

09:30.620 --> 09:31.240
Hurry up!

09:34.620 --> 09:35.880
Look what you've done.

09:36.460 --> 09:37.990
What are you talking about?

09:38.060 --> 09:39.520
What happened to the Lord?

09:49.140 --> 09:50.800
The Lord has treated you well.

09:50.860 --> 09:53.390
Why did you put poison on King Herb to kill him?

09:53.540 --> 09:55.060
What? We didn't do it.

09:55.060 --> 09:55.860
Captain Fang,

09:56.300 --> 09:58.500
Are you sure the King Herb was poisoned?

09:59.100 --> 10:01.210
The Lord started to refine King Herb soon after he got it,

10:01.210 --> 10:02.620
and there was nothing unusual during that time.

10:02.620 --> 10:05.680
If King Herb didn't cause it, then what else could it be?

10:10.180 --> 10:10.980
Captain Fang.

10:12.570 --> 10:13.440
Think about it.

10:13.980 --> 10:16.100
Liu Shao worked so hard to obtain King Herb

10:16.100 --> 10:17.500
because she wanted to use it

10:17.500 --> 10:18.710
to gain a foothold here.

10:18.710 --> 10:20.620
At this time, the Lord was suddenly poisoned,

10:20.620 --> 10:22.450
and all his disciples lost their protection,

10:22.450 --> 10:24.120
which was not good news for Liu Shao.

10:24.120 --> 10:26.880
Right. I'd be hunted by Ao Hen if I left here.

10:26.880 --> 10:29.140
I really want the Lord to live a long life.

10:29.300 --> 10:30.860
How could I try to kill the Lord?

10:30.860 --> 10:31.980
It can't be them.

10:31.980 --> 10:33.460
-Right. -How could she try to kill the lord?

10:33.460 --> 10:34.780
That's right.

10:34.780 --> 10:35.740
It can't be them.

10:35.740 --> 10:36.270
Yes.

10:36.860 --> 10:38.310
We may not know her at all.

10:39.980 --> 10:41.440
I also don't think Liu Shao

10:42.180 --> 10:43.470
would do it.

10:43.890 --> 10:44.870
What about

10:45.340 --> 10:47.670
the grass demon who gave us this King Herb?

10:50.980 --> 10:51.480
Right.

10:51.940 --> 10:53.530
King Herb is so precious.

10:53.530 --> 10:55.820
Why did that grass demon give it to you so easily?

10:55.820 --> 10:57.350
There must be a conspiracy.

10:57.780 --> 10:59.500
That grass demon itself is the King Herb.

10:59.500 --> 11:02.360
It's from the Immortal Palace and now has come back.

11:02.940 --> 11:04.420
Are you going to say

11:04.420 --> 11:07.420
that people from the Immortal Palace harmed the Lord?

11:07.500 --> 11:10.060
No matter who was trying to kill the Lord,

11:10.060 --> 11:12.140
there must have been something wrong with your King Herb.

11:12.140 --> 11:14.000
We can only hold you accountable.

11:16.380 --> 11:18.240
There is still half of the King Herb unrefined.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.870
I will find a doctor to verify

11:19.870 --> 11:21.430
what has been done to it.

11:22.780 --> 11:24.880
But it was presented by you two.

11:25.420 --> 11:27.750
This matter is definitely related to you.

11:33.380 --> 11:33.990
My Lord.

11:35.370 --> 11:35.990
My Lord.

11:38.460 --> 11:39.670
-My Lord. -My Lord.

11:40.460 --> 11:41.110
My Lord.

11:43.260 --> 11:43.910
My Lord.

11:59.420 --> 12:00.220
Captain Fang.

12:00.860 --> 12:02.400
What do we do with these two villains?

12:02.400 --> 12:03.900
I'll leave them to you.

12:03.900 --> 12:04.510
Yes.

12:26.740 --> 12:27.740
Behave yourself.

12:36.090 --> 12:36.710
Lu Li.

12:39.220 --> 12:40.550
Your cell is over there.

12:42.020 --> 12:42.750
Lu Li.

12:45.940 --> 12:46.870
Don't be afraid.

12:47.540 --> 12:49.140
The truth will come out soon.

12:49.800 --> 12:51.860
I promised that I would take you home.

12:52.220 --> 12:52.950
Trust me.

12:53.580 --> 12:54.230
Okay.

13:15.780 --> 13:16.550
Lu Li.

13:17.260 --> 13:18.160
I trust you.

13:19.140 --> 13:22.070
But this time even Marquis Wuyang has been poisoned.

13:22.180 --> 13:23.840
How do we break the deadlock?

13:42.660 --> 13:43.310
Lu Li.

13:43.970 --> 13:45.400
I told you

13:45.400 --> 13:46.590
not to be with her.

13:47.220 --> 13:48.610
Not only did she fail to achieve anything,

13:48.610 --> 13:50.810
but she also dragged you into troubles.

13:50.940 --> 13:51.860
You knew

13:51.860 --> 13:53.790
Liu Shao and I are innocent, right?

13:54.380 --> 13:55.940
Whether you are innocent or not

13:55.940 --> 13:57.550
is up to Du.

14:00.020 --> 14:01.680
Why does Du have the final say?

14:01.940 --> 14:03.800
Shouldn't it depend on the truth?

14:04.180 --> 14:06.780
Neither Marquis Wuyang nor Captain Fang can be in charge.

14:06.780 --> 14:08.460
If Du says it's truth,

14:08.460 --> 14:10.150
then it is.

14:10.150 --> 14:12.580
There is not only Du in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion,

14:12.580 --> 14:13.710
but also you.

14:17.570 --> 14:18.990
I didn't expect

14:19.780 --> 14:21.780
you would become so vicious one day,

14:22.300 --> 14:25.370
that you would kill innocent people for selfish reasons.

14:25.370 --> 14:26.270
Innocent?

14:26.700 --> 14:28.120
Am I not innocent?

14:28.620 --> 14:30.780
You're hurting me by protecting Liu Shao.

14:30.780 --> 14:32.900
What does it have to do with you?

14:32.900 --> 14:34.150
You are my senior.

14:36.290 --> 14:37.950
You've always been my senior.

14:39.140 --> 14:40.790
I was not just your senior.

14:41.820 --> 14:42.660
It's all Liu Shao's fault.

14:42.660 --> 14:44.680
She caught your heart with her seductive look.

14:44.680 --> 14:45.830
It's all her fault.

14:47.700 --> 14:48.720
All.

14:49.820 --> 14:51.350
I will make you

14:52.380 --> 14:53.710
and her regret.

15:23.770 --> 15:24.880
How is the Lord?

15:26.180 --> 15:27.220
The physician said

15:27.220 --> 15:28.750
this poison is too vicious.

15:29.060 --> 15:30.700
It doesn't belong to the human world.

15:30.700 --> 15:31.460
I'll use my vitality

15:31.460 --> 15:32.740
to protect the Lord's heart.

15:32.740 --> 15:34.130
That could buy us some time.

15:34.130 --> 15:36.260
But if we still can't find the antidote,

15:36.260 --> 15:37.990
the Lord won't last long.

15:39.330 --> 15:40.030
What can I

15:40.540 --> 15:41.880
do for the Lord?

15:42.780 --> 15:44.900
Marquis Wuyang's Mansion needs someone to take charge.

15:44.900 --> 15:47.160
You should take the responsibility now.

15:47.580 --> 15:49.780
Manage the daily affairs of the Mansion

15:50.100 --> 15:51.360
and find out the truth.

15:54.140 --> 15:55.340
As long as the Lord is alive,

15:55.340 --> 15:57.110
I will always be his disciple.

15:57.420 --> 15:59.220
Let me do this instead.

15:59.220 --> 16:00.950
It is my job to protect the Lord.

16:02.100 --> 16:03.700
If you are really so sincere,

16:03.940 --> 16:05.600
you should secure the Mansion

16:06.260 --> 16:08.990
and find the cure for the Lord as soon as possible.

16:09.170 --> 16:09.790
Yes.

16:10.540 --> 16:11.540
I'll do as you say.

16:14.460 --> 16:16.560
[Qiutian Pavilion]

16:18.950 --> 16:22.100
[Wu]

16:24.960 --> 16:27.520
[Wu]

16:25.620 --> 16:27.820
Secure the cells and increase patrols.

16:28.020 --> 16:29.750
No one is allowed to visit them.

16:30.140 --> 16:31.120
You may leave.

16:31.120 --> 16:31.830
Yes.

16:49.900 --> 16:52.670
[Wu]

16:50.180 --> 16:51.640
The Lord of the Human World

16:52.020 --> 16:53.510
who rules all human beings

16:54.020 --> 16:55.840
will soon be me.

16:59.660 --> 17:00.750
Bai Feng?

17:05.300 --> 17:07.300
Congratulations, Marquis Wuyang.

17:07.500 --> 17:09.470
Don't talk nonsense.

17:09.940 --> 17:11.140
The Lord is still alive.

17:11.140 --> 17:13.589
I'm just a temporary replacement.

17:14.859 --> 17:16.910
The throne is so comfortable.

17:17.250 --> 17:19.670
Are you willing to give it up?

17:20.540 --> 17:21.460
Bai Feng.

17:21.460 --> 17:23.550
Watch your language.

17:24.740 --> 17:26.000
What are you afraid of?

17:26.859 --> 17:28.310
There's no one else here,

17:28.940 --> 17:31.630
and no need to play ignorant.

17:32.140 --> 17:35.360
Don't act like I don't know what you did.

17:39.340 --> 17:40.650
I didn't do anything.

17:40.650 --> 17:41.580
What do you want?

17:42.740 --> 17:43.790
Nothing.

17:44.220 --> 17:45.750
I'm just reminding you that

17:46.180 --> 17:48.750
we will sink or swim together.

17:49.300 --> 17:51.390
Don't try to kick down the ladder.

17:52.330 --> 17:54.920
Otherwise, even if I die,

17:55.980 --> 17:57.940
I will tell Captain Fang

17:57.940 --> 17:59.470
what you did.

18:03.340 --> 18:04.190
Senior Du,

18:04.660 --> 18:05.700
I was just

18:05.700 --> 18:06.950
reminding you.

18:07.460 --> 18:08.760
As I said,

18:08.760 --> 18:11.420
we will sink or swim together.

18:11.420 --> 18:12.820
What exactly do you want?

18:13.570 --> 18:15.030
I want Liu Shao dead,

18:15.340 --> 18:16.870
and I will do it myself.

18:18.100 --> 18:19.110
That's easy.

18:19.980 --> 18:21.470
I want to keep Lu Li.

18:23.740 --> 18:25.740
He and I have some unfinished business

18:25.740 --> 18:27.150
to take care of.

18:27.420 --> 18:29.020
It has nothing to do with yours.

18:29.020 --> 18:29.800
Now,

18:30.140 --> 18:32.020
you're going to take over Marquis Wuyang.

18:32.020 --> 18:33.680
He is no longer a threat to you.

18:43.460 --> 18:46.300
The matter of the Lord being poisoned has now been investigated clearly.

18:46.300 --> 18:47.900
It was done by Liu Shao alone.

18:48.180 --> 18:50.330
Lu Li was tricked and used by her,

18:50.330 --> 18:51.900
and didn't know at first.

18:51.900 --> 18:54.100
From now on, Lu Li is demoted to a lowly servant.

18:54.100 --> 18:55.840
As for Liu Shao,

19:00.500 --> 19:01.540
she will be left to Bai Feng

19:01.540 --> 19:03.070
and executed immediately.

19:04.140 --> 19:05.020
Execution?

19:05.020 --> 19:06.140
-Execution? -Execution!

19:06.140 --> 19:07.140
How can this be

19:07.140 --> 19:07.780
so serious?

19:07.780 --> 19:09.470
Nonsense! Liu Shao didn't...

19:10.660 --> 19:11.310
Senior Du.

19:12.500 --> 19:13.380
Please don't blame her.

19:13.380 --> 19:15.260
Xue was blinded by Liu Shao and couldn't tell right from wrong.

19:15.260 --> 19:17.100
I'll go back and teach her a lesson.

19:17.100 --> 19:18.760
You better.

19:18.760 --> 19:21.540
We don't need people who don't know any better.

19:21.540 --> 19:22.180
Yes.

19:22.180 --> 19:23.870
I... I'll take her back now.

19:25.620 --> 19:25.940
Wang Jian, you...

19:25.940 --> 19:26.490
Stop talking.

19:26.490 --> 19:27.600
Let's go.

19:37.340 --> 19:38.580
Xue, stop biting me.

19:38.580 --> 19:39.740
You deserve it!

19:39.740 --> 19:40.820
You ungrateful man.

19:40.820 --> 19:42.020
Have you forgotten how Liu Shao helped me?

19:42.020 --> 19:43.060
No, I haven't.

19:43.060 --> 19:44.460
But it is Du in charge now.

19:44.860 --> 19:46.700
We can't play tough with him.

19:46.700 --> 19:48.100
Do you really want to be kicked out of the Mansion?

19:48.100 --> 19:49.160
Do you have an idea?

19:50.300 --> 19:51.860
Isn't Liu Shao going to be executed?

19:51.860 --> 19:53.620
But my brother is fine.

19:53.620 --> 19:55.470
He's just locked in prison.

19:56.020 --> 19:57.260
They will definitely execute Liu Shao

19:57.260 --> 19:58.540
before releasing him.

19:58.540 --> 19:59.140
I know.

19:59.140 --> 20:00.520
But we can go to him.

20:00.520 --> 20:01.460
He's full of ideas.

20:01.460 --> 20:02.580
My grandfather

20:02.580 --> 20:03.980
had a few old friends in the Mansion.

20:03.980 --> 20:04.860
They can't do anything else,

20:04.860 --> 20:05.700
but it's not a problem for us

20:05.700 --> 20:06.750
to visit him.

20:18.660 --> 20:19.230
Brother.

20:20.740 --> 20:21.520
Brother.

20:21.520 --> 20:22.380
Why are you here?

20:22.380 --> 20:23.100
How are things outside?

20:23.100 --> 20:24.050
Terrible.

20:24.050 --> 20:25.780
The Lord is still unconscious.

20:27.460 --> 20:28.660
Now Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

20:28.660 --> 20:31.120
is basically under Du Mingchong's control.

20:33.500 --> 20:35.240
Anyway, Bai Feng

20:35.580 --> 20:37.380
doesn't look like a good person.

20:37.930 --> 20:39.590
Xue is worried about Liu Shao.

20:40.500 --> 20:41.980
It's useless to beg Bai Feng.

20:41.980 --> 20:43.740
She will definitely kill Liu Shao.

20:43.740 --> 20:44.980
In order to catch He Na,

20:44.980 --> 20:46.710
she took Du to hurt Liu Shao.

20:47.660 --> 20:49.670
I now get scared

20:50.260 --> 20:51.990
every time I see her fake smile.

20:52.060 --> 20:53.690
The fire in the Pearl Pavilion

20:53.690 --> 20:55.620
must have something to do with her.

20:58.290 --> 20:59.620
Help me find two people.

20:59.820 --> 21:01.480
They should be able to help us.

21:11.330 --> 21:12.110
Lu Li.

21:14.180 --> 21:14.830
Lu Li!

21:16.780 --> 21:17.750
Lu Li.

21:20.860 --> 21:22.470
I wonder how Lu Li is now.

21:24.340 --> 21:25.580
I don't know what Bai Feng

21:25.580 --> 21:26.780
will do with Liu Shao.

21:30.580 --> 21:31.120
Lu Li.

21:31.780 --> 21:33.150
What should we do now?

21:36.860 --> 21:38.580
I have to get out of here as soon as possible

21:38.580 --> 21:40.160
to save Liu Shao.

21:42.380 --> 21:44.190
I hope Lu Li is fine.

21:45.420 --> 21:46.070
Yes.

21:47.580 --> 21:49.000
We'll all be fine.

21:53.300 --> 21:53.980
Unlock the door.

21:53.980 --> 21:54.910
Yes.

22:25.260 --> 22:28.100
Your verdict has come out.

22:28.100 --> 22:29.360
Don't you want to know?

22:31.100 --> 22:32.960
I don't think it will be good news.

22:36.100 --> 22:37.320
Lu Li said

22:37.620 --> 22:38.900
that the King Herb

22:38.900 --> 22:40.460
had been kept by you all the time.

22:40.460 --> 22:41.790
He had never known that.

22:42.420 --> 22:43.840
He also said

22:43.840 --> 22:45.260
that you had been acting weird,

22:45.260 --> 22:47.670
and were in contact with the demons.

22:47.980 --> 22:51.310
Maybe you were bewitched by the demons

22:51.740 --> 22:54.510
and asked them for poison to murder the Lord.

22:55.460 --> 22:57.590
Because the evidence was solid,

22:57.900 --> 22:59.760
Du has made his decision quickly.

23:01.060 --> 23:02.220
Lu Li

23:02.220 --> 23:03.950
was demoted to a lowly servant.

23:04.170 --> 23:04.990
And you...

23:05.380 --> 23:08.230
will be executed immediately.

23:25.260 --> 23:26.280
This verdict

23:27.060 --> 23:28.030
should be true.

23:30.540 --> 23:32.160
But it must have been hard

23:32.580 --> 23:34.180
for you to make up those lies.

23:34.580 --> 23:36.780
I might have believed you,

23:36.780 --> 23:38.840
if I didn't know anything about Lu Li.

23:39.860 --> 23:40.780
You don't believe me?

23:40.780 --> 23:41.870
Of course not.

23:42.540 --> 23:43.750
Why not?

23:45.020 --> 23:46.150
Because he's Lu Li,

23:46.700 --> 23:47.950
and I'm Liu Shao.

23:48.900 --> 23:50.710
You are really stuborn.

23:51.100 --> 23:51.670
Fine.

23:52.460 --> 23:53.940
Let's see if you still believe him

23:53.940 --> 23:56.360
when you are about to die

23:56.360 --> 23:58.150
and no one comes

23:58.810 --> 24:00.560
to help you.

24:34.060 --> 24:35.270
You know magic too?

24:37.900 --> 24:40.630
You're right.

24:41.380 --> 24:43.540
Actually, I basically know every magic

24:43.540 --> 24:45.080
that Lu Li knows.

24:46.340 --> 24:47.950
Do you wonder why?

24:48.340 --> 24:49.190
Why?

24:50.930 --> 24:54.060
Because I grew up with him,

24:54.060 --> 24:56.640
and was meant to be with him.

24:57.500 --> 24:59.500
I'm his senior.

24:59.500 --> 25:02.190
Lu Sheng is also my master.

25:03.900 --> 25:05.340
It seems he still has a lot of things

25:05.340 --> 25:06.550
to hide from you.

25:07.020 --> 25:08.220
He must have done that

25:08.500 --> 25:09.950
for a reason.

25:10.500 --> 25:11.560
I still trust him.

25:13.660 --> 25:14.700
I knew it.

25:14.700 --> 25:16.420
People who have never suffered

25:16.420 --> 25:19.060
are really naive and ridiculous.

25:19.060 --> 25:20.110
Naive people

25:20.540 --> 25:22.110
live a simple, happy,

25:22.110 --> 25:23.270
free and open life.

25:23.820 --> 25:25.540
There is nothing to be proud of

25:25.540 --> 25:27.260
living a hypocritical

25:27.260 --> 25:28.710
and unstable life.

25:29.140 --> 25:30.680
How dare you laugh at me?

25:31.300 --> 25:32.980
I'm laughing at

25:32.980 --> 25:34.070
those hypocrites.

25:34.580 --> 25:35.320
What?

25:36.090 --> 25:37.940
Are you also like this?

25:37.940 --> 25:38.750
Fine.

25:39.740 --> 25:41.340
Then I will be frank with you.

25:42.140 --> 25:43.110
Let me tell you

25:44.060 --> 25:45.620
how much I hate you,

25:45.620 --> 25:47.790
and how much I want you to die.

25:50.580 --> 25:51.680
Liu Shao,

25:52.180 --> 25:53.550
enjoy it.

25:54.060 --> 25:56.340
I'll make you suffer.

25:56.340 --> 25:58.320
I want you to know the truth.

25:58.320 --> 25:59.540
Lu Li was just using you

25:59.540 --> 26:01.470
to help him pull out the Moon Sword.

26:03.700 --> 26:05.740
The evil ones are usually the most pitiful.

26:05.740 --> 26:07.200
Your heart is too vicious.

26:07.500 --> 26:09.570
And you are deluded yourself that Lu Li will like you.

26:09.570 --> 26:11.300
But everyone will hate you

26:11.300 --> 26:12.960
when they see your hypocrisy.

26:13.090 --> 26:13.830
You...

26:51.820 --> 26:52.550
Ao Hen.

26:53.580 --> 26:56.670
I've prepared what you wanted.

27:07.420 --> 27:08.600
You're here.

27:10.060 --> 27:11.710
I brought you Liu Shao.

27:13.020 --> 27:13.990
Good.

27:16.260 --> 27:17.070
Take it.

27:17.700 --> 27:20.500
This demon energy is yours now.

27:20.500 --> 27:22.460
But you'll have to figure out

27:22.460 --> 27:25.400
how to absorb it for your own use.

27:28.260 --> 27:29.590
I have one more request.

27:30.900 --> 27:32.070
Go ahead.

27:36.460 --> 27:38.830
Liu Shao has made me so angry,

27:39.220 --> 27:40.750
and made you suffer so much.

27:42.020 --> 27:44.390
You have to let her die in pain.

27:48.180 --> 27:49.030
No problem.

27:50.820 --> 27:53.830
If Lu Li and He Na knew

27:54.140 --> 27:56.300
that the person they wanted to protect so much

27:56.300 --> 27:58.960
couldn't even die as her wish,

27:58.960 --> 28:00.050
how would they

28:00.050 --> 28:02.270
react?

28:13.940 --> 28:15.640
In that case,

28:16.020 --> 28:19.030
just stay here and suffer.

28:45.140 --> 28:45.790
Lu Li,

28:46.540 --> 28:49.430
I have persuaded Senior Du to let you go.

28:50.020 --> 28:51.190
But he had to

28:51.740 --> 28:53.390
let me seal your Qihai first.

28:56.660 --> 28:57.790
Don't you trust me?

28:58.740 --> 28:59.940
Of course I trust you.

29:01.640 --> 29:03.770
It might hurt a little, so bear with it.

29:27.540 --> 29:28.470
Lu Li...

29:39.460 --> 29:40.190
Be careful.

29:46.100 --> 29:47.070
Sit here.

29:54.500 --> 29:56.110
Are you feeling unwell?

29:57.460 --> 29:59.190
I don't want this to happen too.

30:00.060 --> 30:01.700
When this matter is over,

30:01.700 --> 30:03.340
I will ask Senior Du

30:03.340 --> 30:05.070
to unseal your Qihai acupoint.

30:07.220 --> 30:08.510
Thank you so much.

30:13.420 --> 30:14.740
Try this.

30:14.740 --> 30:17.100
These are osmanthus cakes that I made myself.

30:17.100 --> 30:18.380
You used to love it the most.

30:18.380 --> 30:20.910
And I picked these osmanthus flowers myself.

30:30.180 --> 30:33.380
These are really like the cakes you made when we were kids.

30:34.060 --> 30:36.260
You used to want to eat this

30:36.260 --> 30:37.660
every time you were sick.

30:38.050 --> 30:40.230
I worked so hard to get osmanthus

30:40.230 --> 30:42.560
so that you can eat osmanthus cakes again.

30:45.850 --> 30:46.630
Yeah.

30:47.740 --> 30:48.790
I still remember

30:49.580 --> 30:50.780
that after I got well,

30:51.620 --> 30:52.740
I fed the rest of the osmanthus cakes

30:52.740 --> 30:54.340
to a parrot demon.

30:54.340 --> 30:56.400
You pretended not to care at the time.

30:57.610 --> 30:59.740
But then the parrot demon disappeared

30:59.860 --> 31:01.350
and never appeared again.

31:04.300 --> 31:05.750
You really

31:06.020 --> 31:08.080
haven't changed since you were a kid.

31:11.900 --> 31:13.030
You would always get

31:13.460 --> 31:14.700
what you want.

31:14.700 --> 31:16.630
You're selfish and unscrupulous.

31:17.620 --> 31:19.340
Your Qihai acupoint is not sealed.

31:19.340 --> 31:20.340
How could this be?

31:21.700 --> 31:22.960
And it's not just that.

31:27.740 --> 31:29.740
It's master's Psychedelic Amulet.

31:29.860 --> 31:30.590
Yes.

31:31.060 --> 31:33.380
I also asked Xue to send a message to master.

31:33.380 --> 31:34.770
Help me find two people.

31:34.770 --> 31:36.930
I told him you wanted to kill Liu Shao.

31:36.930 --> 31:38.170
Give it to Lu Li.

31:38.170 --> 31:41.030
That will trap Bai Feng for at least one tor two days.

31:41.060 --> 31:41.710
Yes.

31:46.540 --> 31:48.000
Liu Shao is dead.

31:48.000 --> 31:49.290
You can't save her.

31:49.290 --> 31:50.940
I once left a wisp of spiritual power

31:50.940 --> 31:52.220
in Liu Shao's lake bead bracelet.

31:52.220 --> 31:54.110
That way I could sense her life and death.

31:54.110 --> 31:56.080
When can you

31:56.590 --> 31:57.990
stop lying?

31:58.260 --> 31:59.170
Okay.

31:59.170 --> 32:00.540
Even if she is not dead,

32:00.540 --> 32:01.830
what can you do?

32:02.100 --> 32:04.010
She has been controlled by Ao Hen.

32:04.010 --> 32:05.720
The great demon, Ao Hen.

32:06.140 --> 32:07.700
Are you able to defeat her?

32:07.700 --> 32:09.160
How do I know if I don't try?

32:23.980 --> 32:25.080
Let me out!

32:28.140 --> 32:30.150
Let me out!

32:33.940 --> 32:35.670
Let's see how long you can last.

33:04.060 --> 33:04.710
Liu Shao.

33:06.140 --> 33:06.750
Liu Shao.

33:07.500 --> 33:08.070
Liu Shao.

33:09.740 --> 33:11.470
It's great that you're fine.

33:13.100 --> 33:14.990
Run. Don't worry about me.

33:16.460 --> 33:17.160
Liu Shao.

33:17.980 --> 33:19.030
I won't leave you.

33:21.660 --> 33:24.630
Your love is so touching.

33:24.940 --> 33:25.950
Fine.

33:26.580 --> 33:27.910
Then

33:27.910 --> 33:29.910
I will fulfill you.

33:48.260 --> 33:49.070
Lu Li!

33:52.780 --> 33:53.350
Lu Li!

33:55.340 --> 33:56.190
Lu Li.

33:56.740 --> 33:57.960
Lu Li, are you okay?

33:58.330 --> 34:00.150
Just go. She just wants me.

34:00.660 --> 34:01.630
Silly girl.

34:02.460 --> 34:04.040
But I just want to save you.

34:05.300 --> 34:07.750
Without Lu Sheng's help today,

34:08.060 --> 34:10.790
let me see if you can escape.

34:35.980 --> 34:37.750
Demon King in White?

34:38.580 --> 34:39.870
He Na.

34:43.020 --> 34:44.030
He Na.

34:44.030 --> 34:45.280
Demon King in White,

34:45.280 --> 34:46.909
you've saved your people.

34:47.290 --> 34:48.889
Why are you still against me?

34:49.100 --> 34:50.909
They are my friends.

34:51.489 --> 34:52.510
Friends?

34:54.100 --> 34:55.960
You are a demon king.

34:55.960 --> 34:59.890
How could you be friends with the disciples of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion?

34:59.890 --> 35:01.070
Why not?

35:02.100 --> 35:03.190
Nothing.

35:03.940 --> 35:05.980
Just don't forget

35:05.980 --> 35:07.860
that you are an Aquatic Demon.

35:07.860 --> 35:10.590
In the water, you do have a distinguished status.

35:10.820 --> 35:13.030
But now it's on land,

35:13.030 --> 35:14.940
I'm the king here.

35:14.940 --> 35:18.020
How long can you hold without water?

35:18.020 --> 35:19.990
You want to protect them?

35:21.300 --> 35:22.700
Water?

35:22.700 --> 35:24.120
We have plenty.

35:29.620 --> 35:30.230
Liu Shao.

35:31.740 --> 35:32.990
Get up.

35:37.660 --> 35:39.350
Is this little water

35:39.940 --> 35:42.070
enough for you?

35:43.700 --> 35:46.510
What if I use the Water Amulet my grandpa left me?

35:49.260 --> 35:50.510
Watch carefully.

36:12.220 --> 36:13.790
I will

36:14.100 --> 36:15.540
spare them today.

36:15.540 --> 36:16.780
I'd like to see

36:16.780 --> 36:19.030
how long you can protect them.

36:22.940 --> 36:23.860
Don't go.

36:23.860 --> 36:25.150
There's more.

36:30.340 --> 36:31.270
Are you okay?

36:32.260 --> 36:32.950
He Na.

36:33.410 --> 36:34.490
Thank you.

36:34.490 --> 36:35.870
Thank you, kid.

36:38.420 --> 36:39.190
Young man,

36:39.540 --> 36:43.220
I heard that the Water Amulet has disappeared for almost a thousand years.

36:43.220 --> 36:45.170
It wasn't Water Amulet.

36:45.170 --> 36:46.740
That was the Thunder Amulet.

36:46.740 --> 36:49.670
I just used it to create some illusions of lightning.

36:49.820 --> 36:51.150
Why didn't you say it earlier?

36:51.150 --> 36:52.880
Now is the best time to tell you.

36:53.110 --> 36:54.690
That's not the point.

36:54.690 --> 36:55.750
Let's go out first.

36:56.420 --> 36:57.340
You can't go.

36:57.340 --> 36:58.540
You must not go back.

36:58.540 --> 37:01.130
Let's find a place to rest first.

37:01.130 --> 37:01.670
Let's go.

37:01.680 --> 37:02.350
Okay.

37:05.900 --> 37:06.640
Liu Shao.

37:06.640 --> 37:07.450
Liu Shao.

37:07.450 --> 37:08.010
Liu Shao.

37:08.010 --> 37:08.670
Liu Shao.

37:09.380 --> 37:09.910
Liu Shao.

37:34.100 --> 37:34.710
Thank you.

37:36.900 --> 37:39.100
Mr. Tai is the best doctor in the demon world.

37:39.100 --> 37:41.160
His prescription is very effective.

37:41.420 --> 37:42.280
She will wake up

37:42.580 --> 37:43.180
tomorrow.

37:46.460 --> 37:47.900
You were also seriously injured.

37:47.900 --> 37:49.160
Go back and take a rest.

37:49.780 --> 37:50.310
I'm fine.

37:51.620 --> 37:52.210
He Na.

37:53.010 --> 37:53.750
Thank you

37:54.520 --> 37:55.920
for helping us this time.

37:57.020 --> 37:59.680
I didn't expect that Wang Jian really found you.

38:00.100 --> 38:03.100
And you were really willing to take the risk to save us.

38:05.940 --> 38:06.740
It's my fault.

38:08.460 --> 38:10.520
I should have left her a way to find me.

38:11.330 --> 38:13.210
Otherwise, she wouldn't be like this,

38:13.210 --> 38:15.210
and couldn't even be able to tell me.

38:15.860 --> 38:16.270
He Na.

38:17.300 --> 38:17.960
From now on,

38:18.980 --> 38:20.710
I will do my best to protect her.

38:21.480 --> 38:23.340
I won't let anyone hurt her again.

38:26.380 --> 38:27.150
I know.

38:28.900 --> 38:29.710
But now,

38:32.220 --> 38:34.280
you are not capable of doing so at all.

38:35.220 --> 38:36.480
Soul-Devouring Spell

38:37.370 --> 38:39.790
will make you die very quickly.

38:40.460 --> 38:41.660
How long can you live?

38:42.940 --> 38:44.200
Do you still have time?

38:47.780 --> 38:48.270
My Lord.

38:49.020 --> 38:49.670
Mr. Lu.

38:52.340 --> 38:54.640
The spy at Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

38:55.140 --> 38:56.680
gave me

38:56.680 --> 38:58.480
a tuft of Marquis Wuyang's hair.

38:59.500 --> 39:00.790
I've checked it.

39:07.340 --> 39:09.470
Is it weird

39:09.980 --> 39:12.690
that one or two greedy people in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion

39:12.690 --> 39:13.690
became our spies?

39:15.040 --> 39:15.880
No.

39:16.500 --> 39:18.760
You get to know the enemy better this way.

39:19.140 --> 39:20.820
Mr. Tai, please go ahead.

39:22.660 --> 39:24.940
What hurt Marquis Wuyang was the demon poison.

39:24.940 --> 39:27.190
It was most likely done by Ao Hen.

39:27.980 --> 39:30.220
This poison is refined

39:30.220 --> 39:31.740
by collecting the resentment of many people and demons.

39:31.740 --> 39:32.460
I can't

39:32.460 --> 39:34.360
cure this poison.

39:36.660 --> 39:38.460
Now that Marquis Wuyang is sick,

39:38.660 --> 39:40.950
the Marquis Wuyang's Mansion is controlled by Du Mingchong.

39:40.950 --> 39:43.050
Then Liu Shao won't be able to prove her innocence.

39:43.050 --> 39:45.110
How can she go back to the human world?

39:45.300 --> 39:46.560
I will go to Ao Hen again

39:47.070 --> 39:48.400
if there is no other way.

39:48.860 --> 39:50.300
She must have the antidote.

39:50.300 --> 39:51.740
But she won't come to the water.

39:51.740 --> 39:53.440
And you can't defeat her on land.

39:53.440 --> 39:55.500
How are you going to get the antidote?

39:55.500 --> 39:56.330
I have to

39:57.100 --> 39:57.880
give it a try.

39:59.260 --> 40:01.180
Now that Marquis Wuyang is in a coma.

40:01.180 --> 40:02.910
If anything bad happens to you,

40:02.940 --> 40:05.720
then the three worlds will definitely be in chaos.

40:05.720 --> 40:06.350
My Lord,

40:06.890 --> 40:07.820
although I can't

40:07.930 --> 40:09.760
deal with this poison,

40:09.760 --> 40:11.560
there is one thing that can work.

40:19.420 --> 40:22.190
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

40:35.860 --> 40:37.520
Be careful. Don't get caught.

40:38.780 --> 40:39.190
Stop!

40:44.500 --> 40:45.340
-Senior Du. -Senior Du.

40:45.340 --> 40:46.790
Where have you been?

40:47.250 --> 40:47.960
We

40:47.960 --> 40:50.110
just went around the demon world.

40:50.540 --> 40:51.270
Demon world?

40:51.980 --> 40:53.300
What were you doing there?

40:53.300 --> 40:55.380
We heard that the Lord has been poisoned by demon poison

40:55.380 --> 40:57.510
and wanted to see if there was any clue.

40:58.100 --> 40:58.900
Demon poison?

40:59.700 --> 41:01.100
So did you find any clues?

41:01.780 --> 41:03.470
We were walking there

41:03.980 --> 41:05.740
and then we seemed to enter the territory of Ao Hen.

41:05.740 --> 41:07.190
So we hurried back.

41:11.140 --> 41:12.070
But

41:12.070 --> 41:14.310
we saw pieces of clothes all over the place there.

41:14.310 --> 41:15.590
All over the place.

41:15.900 --> 41:17.100
So I brought one back.

41:17.220 --> 41:18.880
This belongs to Liu Shao.

41:18.880 --> 41:20.280
Yes, she's right.

41:22.660 --> 41:23.270
Wait, Xue.

41:23.660 --> 41:25.380
Wasn't Liu Shao already executed

41:25.380 --> 41:25.980
by Senior Bai Feng?

41:25.980 --> 41:27.510
How could she appear there?

41:27.940 --> 41:28.700
That's right.

41:28.700 --> 41:30.500
But she deserved it as a traitor.

41:33.140 --> 41:33.670
Ao Hen?

41:34.580 --> 41:37.140
How could Senior Bai Feng have anything to do with Ao Hen?

41:37.140 --> 41:38.270
You must be wrong.

41:38.900 --> 41:41.300
Don't slander and spread rumors casually.

41:42.980 --> 41:43.780
You're right.

41:44.100 --> 41:45.480
We must be wrong.

41:46.540 --> 41:47.670
You can off to go now.

41:48.170 --> 41:49.110
Yes, senior.

42:16.620 --> 42:17.550
Lu Li.

42:18.420 --> 42:20.220
You've been staring at this tree

42:20.380 --> 42:21.870
for a long time.

42:23.180 --> 42:24.840
I'm just waiting for a flower.

42:25.060 --> 42:26.240
I heard from Mr. Tai

42:26.420 --> 42:28.030
that a female flower from the Brahma tree

42:28.030 --> 42:29.900
can cure all poisons in the demon world.

42:29.900 --> 42:31.080
But I think

42:31.620 --> 42:33.190
this tree is dead.

42:33.660 --> 42:35.460
The old demon, He Na told me

42:35.800 --> 42:38.070
that this tree died longer than he lived.

42:38.900 --> 42:40.010
Old demon?

42:40.010 --> 42:40.470
Yes.

42:41.820 --> 42:42.750
He Na is old.

42:43.090 --> 42:45.090
He is one thousand and one years old.

42:45.530 --> 42:46.990
I am much younger than him.

42:49.800 --> 42:51.790
This tree died before he was born.

42:51.990 --> 42:53.830
He had never even seen the leaves of this tree,

42:53.830 --> 42:55.110
and let alone the flowers.

42:55.110 --> 42:56.740
I heard that Liu Shao had woken up,

42:56.740 --> 42:58.420
so I brought wine to celebrate.

42:58.420 --> 43:00.260
I heard you talking about me from a distance.

43:00.260 --> 43:01.660
Did I say anything wrong?

43:03.340 --> 43:04.390
Nothing.

43:07.100 --> 43:08.200
In fact,

43:08.200 --> 43:10.620
the Brahma tree has started to wither since 10,000 years ago.

43:10.620 --> 43:12.540
The Water hyacinth that grows from the Brahma tree

43:12.540 --> 43:14.830
has always existed only in the story.

43:16.540 --> 43:17.790
But that poison

43:18.580 --> 43:21.640
only left Marquis Wuyang a maximum of five days to live.

43:23.460 --> 43:24.580
How do we make this tree,

43:24.580 --> 43:26.530
which has been dead for 10,000 years,

43:26.530 --> 43:27.950
bloom in five days?
